      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wait, why would you ever have `dest-branch` set to something under `refs/tags/`? You can\u0027t upload tags as changes.\n\ndest-branch is a reasonable guess for an upstream because it\u0027s the location changes are intended to be uploaded to for review. Removing it from the fallback list hurts that reasonable assumption.",
